    "body": "This PR has been updated to include the \"opt-in\" mechanics described in [#912](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/912). The changes I made here roughly match the current implementation of Chromium, so I'm hoping they're functional. But comments appreciated.\r\n\r\nHere, I am unable to figure out how to get the \"magic\" `{{include shadow roots state}}` to link over to the equivalent section of HTML. I get a build error there. I cannot find where in dom.bs these strings are defined.\r\n",
